# The context of the `naru` named context of image/pkgs/docker-bake.hcl (the repository root):
# the Go workspace and the sources the image's programs are built from, and nothing else, so that
# build/, bin/, docs/ and the worktrees do not enter the build's inputs or its cache key. The other
# contexts of the bake file are folders of their own and read no file of this one.
*
!go.work
!go.work.sum
!lib
!host
!node
!orch
!naructl
!tooling
**/*_test.go
